ers. He"},{"start":317,"text":"answers the question."},{"start":319,"text":"Why do we pronounce cat? Cat or pack? P"},{"start":326,"text":"pack. That's a cat. We have to pack."},{"start":332,"text":"Why?"},{"start":334,"text":"He explains it all. Connected speech"},{"start":339,"text":"crucial for intermediate learners."},{"start":343,"text":"learners who want to improve their"},{"start":346,"text":"pronunciation."},{"start":348,"text":"I think you'll learn so much in this"},{"start":352,"text":"class. That's why I'm so excited to"},{"start":357,"text":"collab with Skillshare. I found this"},{"start":360,"text":"class to be so informative even for me"},{"start":366,"text":"to focus on the things that my students"},{"start":370,"text":"need to focus on. And the beauty of"},{"start":374,"text":"Skillshare is that I can practice"},{"start":378,"text":"whenever I want at my own pace. To me,"},{"start":385,"text":"that's the most important part because"},{"start":389,"text":"my schedule is all over the place."},{"start":393,"text":"Skillshare has creative classes taught"},{"start":397,"text":"by worldclass creatives like"},{"start":400,"text":"professional illustrators,"},{"start":403,"text":"renowned graphic designers, and"},{"start":407,"text":"successful entrepreneurs."},{"start":410,"text":"It's the best place to learn a new skill"},{"start":415,"text":"or new hobbies."},{"start":417,"text":"The first 500 people to click the link"},{"start":421,"text":"in my description or scan the QR code"},{"start":426,"text":"will receive a one month free trial of"},{"start":430,"text":"Skillshare. Try it out. It's one month"},{"start":434,"text":"for free and I assure you, you won't"},{"start":438,"text":"want to leave."},{"start":441,"text":"Back to the video. You got it. No"},{"start":444,"text":"onions."},{"start":446,"text":"Anything else?"},{"start":450,"text":"Is this for here or to go?"},{"start":457,"text":"Perfect."},{"start":458,"text":"Your total is 14.85. 85."},{"start":466,"text":"Absolutely."},{"start":468,"text":"You can tap or insert your card right"},{"start":474,"text":"here."},{"start":481,"text":"Yes, you can leave a tip if you'd like,"},{"start":487,"text":"but it's completely optional."},{"start":493,"text":"Thank you. We appreciate it."},{"start":499,"text":"Would you like any sauces with that?"},{"start":505,"text":"We have ketchup,"},{"start":507,"text":"ranch,"},{"start":509,"text":"barbecue,"},{"start":511,"text":"or honey mustard."},{"start":517,"text":"Sure thing. Ranch and barbecue."},{"start":522,"text":"Anything else?"},{"start":528,"text":"No problem at all. I'll switch that to a"},{"start":533,"text":"large sprite then."},{"start":537,"text":"Of course."},{"start":539,"text":"All right. Your order number is 27."},{"start":545,"text":"We'll call your number when it's ready."},{"start":554,"text":"About 10"},{"start":557,"text":"to 15 minutes"},{"start":563,"text":"when the food is ready."},{"start":567,"text":"Number 27."},{"start":573,"text":"Here you go."},{"start":575,"text":"A double cheeseburger"},{"start":578,"text":"with bacon,"},{"start":580,"text":"no onions,"},{"start":582,"text":"large fries,"},{"start":584,"text":"a large Sprite,"},{"start":587,"text":"ranch, and barbecue sauce. Right."},{"start":593,"text":"You're welcome. Enjoy."},{"start":596,"text":"Now, let's practice what happens if"},{"start":600,"text":"something is wrong or missing."},{"start":608,"text":"I'm so sorry about that."},{"start":611,"text":"Let me fix that for you right away."},{"start":618,"text":"Of course, we'll remake it fresh. It'll"},{"start":623,"text":"just be a few minutes."},{"start":630,"text":"[snorts]"},{"start":632,"text":"Yes,"},{"start":634,"text":"fountain drinks come with free refills."},{"start":644,"text":"It's down the hall to your left."},{"start":650,"text":"No problem."},{"start":654,"text":"Now, let's role play at the grocery"},{"start":659,"text":"store."},{"start":666,"text":"Yes, I do. How can I help you?"},{"start":674,"text":"Um, which brand are you looking for?"},{"start":683,"text":"It's in aisle 7"},{"start":686,"text":"next to the canned vegetables."},{"start":692,"text":"No problem."},{"start":695,"text":"Hi there. Did you find everything okay?"},{"start":703,"text":"Great. Do you have a rewards number with"},{"start":708,"text":"us? Would"},{"start":712,"text":"you like to sign up?"},{"start":716,"text":"It's free and you save money."},{"start":723,"text":"No problem."},{"start":727,"text":"Would you like paper or plastic bags?"},{"start":736,"text":"All right."},{"start":738,"text":"Do you need help to your car?"},{"start":745,"text":"Okay. Your total is $6842."},{"start":755,"text":"Tell me about it."},{"start":760,"text":"Yes. Go ahead and insert or tap your"},{"start":766,"text":"card."},{"start":771,"text":"If you select yes, we can give you cash"},{"start":777,"text":"from your card."},{"start":781,"text":"All right, you're all set."},{"start":787,"text":"Of course, here you go."},{"start":794,"text":"Let me check that for you."},{"start":798,"text":"Yes, you're right. I'll refund one of"},{"start":803,"text":"them."},{"start":807,"text":"No problem at all."},{"start":810,"text":"Sorry for the confusion."},{"start":812,"text":"Maybe you prefer selfch checkout."},{"start":821,"text":"That happens sometimes."},{"start":825,"text":"Let me clear it for you."},{"start":831,"text":"You didn't do anything wrong."},{"start":834,"text":"It's just glitchy."},{"start":838,"text":"Glitchy is something that easily"},{"start":841,"text":"glitches."},{"start":843,"text":"Do you know what glitch means?"},{"start":848,"text":"All right. You're all set."},{"start":853,"text":"Have a great day"},{"start":857,"text":"now at the airport."},{"start":863,"text":"Hi there. Where are you flying today?"},{"start":872,"text":"May I see your passport, please?"},{"start":879,"text":"Thank you. Are you checking any bags"},{"start":884,"text":"today?"},{"start":888,"text":"All right. Would you mind placing it on"},{"start":892,"text":"the scale for me?"},{"start":899,"text":"It's 52B."},{"start":903,"text":"The limit is 50."},{"start":910,"text":"You can remove a few items"},{"start":914,"text":"or pay the overweight"},{"start":918,"text":"fee."},{"start":923,"text":"It's $75."},{"start":929,"text":"No problem."},{"start":931,"text":"Would you prefer an aisle seat or a"},{"start":935,"text":"window seat?"},{"start":940,"text":"Let me check."},{"start":942,"text":"You're assigned to the window seat, but"},{"start":946,"text":"I can switch you."},{"start":951,"text":"Here is your boarding pass."},{"start":954,"text":"Boarding starts at"},{"start":954.6,"text":"at gate B12."},{"start":965,"text":"Departure is at"},{"start":2405,"text":"."},{"start":2405.6,"text":"You're welcome."},{"start":2406.2,"text":"Security is straight ahead and to your"},{"start":2406.8,"text":"right"},{"start":2407.4,"text":"at the security checkpoint."},{"start":2408,"text":"Come to line three."},{"start":2408.6,"text":"Please place your bag on the belt."},{"start":2409.2,"text":"Yes, laptops and liquids need to be in a"},{"start":2409.8,"text":"separate bin."},{"start":2410.4,"text":"Do you have any liquids over 3.4 oz?"},{"start":2411,"text":"Please remove your shoes and belt."},{"start":2411.6,"text":"Step through the scanner, please."},{"start":2412.2,"text":"Yes. This is for flight 482"},{"start":2412.8,"text":"to Chicago."},{"start":2413.4,"text":"Not yet. will begin boarding in about 10"},{"start":2414,"text":"minutes."},{"start":2414.6,"text":"Actually, there's a small delay"},{"start":2415.2,"text":"about 30 minutes"},{"start":2415.8,"text":"due to weather."},{"start":2416.4,"text":"We are now boarding group one."},{"start":2417,"text":"You're in group three."},{"start":2417.6,"text":"We'll call you shortly."},{"start":2418.2,"text":"A small travel problem."},{"start":2418.8,"text":"Yes, it moved to gate B8."},{"start":2419.4,"text":"It's about a fiveinut walk."},{"start":2420,"text":"Not too far."},{"start":2420.6,"text":"Welcome aboard."},{"start":2421.2,"text":"Can I see your boarding pass?"},{"start":2421.8,"text":"You're in seat 14 C. It's on the left."},{"start":2422.4,"text":"Yes, you can place it in the overhead"},{"start":2423,"text":"bin."},{"start":2423.6,"text":"Let me see if there are any available"},{"start":2424.2,"text":"seats."},{"start":2424.8,"text":"It looks like the flight is full. I'm"},{"start":2425.4,"text":"sorry."},{"start":2426,"text":"After landing,"},{"start":2426.6,"text":"follow the sign downstairs."},{"start":2427.2,"text":"Carousel 6."},{"start":2427.8,"text":"If you lost your luggage."},{"start":2428.4,"text":"I'm sorry to hear that. Can I see your"},{"start":2429,"text":"baggage claim tag?"},{"start":2429.6,"text":"Okay. We'll file a report and contact"},{"start":2430.2,"text":"you once it arrives."},{"start":2430.8,"text":"Typically"},{"start":2431.4,"text":"24 to 48 hours."},{"start":2432,"text":"No problem."},{"start":2432.6,"text":"Calling the doctor's office to make an"},{"start":2433.2,"text":"appointment."},{"start":2433.8,"text":"Good morning. Dr. Miller's office. How"},{"start":2434.4,"text":"can I help you?"},{"start":2435,"text":"Of course."},{"start":2435.6,"text":"Is this for a regular checkup or are you"},{"start":2436.2,"text":"feeling"},{"start":2436.8,"text":"sick?"},{"start":2437.4,"text":"I'm sorry to hear that. What symptoms"},{"start":2438,"text":"are you having?"},{"start":2438.6,"text":"How long have you had these symptoms?"},{"start":2439.2,"text":"Okay,"},{"start":2439.8,"text":"we have an opening tomorrow at 1000 a.m."},{"start":2440.4,"text":"Does that work for you?"},{"start":2441,"text":"Great. Can I have your full name and"},{"start":2441.6,"text":"date of birth, please?"},{"start":2442.2,"text":"Perfect."},{"start":2442.8,"text":"Please arrive 15 minutes early to fill"},{"start":2443.4,"text":"out some paperwork."},{"start":2444,"text":"No problem. See you here."},{"start":2444.6,"text":"Checking in at the office."},{"start":2445.2,"text":"Hi, how can I help you?"},{"start":2445.8,"text":"Name, please."},{"start":2446.4,"text":"Thank you. Can I see your ID and"},{"start":2447,"text":"insurance card?"},{"start":2447.6,"text":"Please take a seat. The nurse will call"},{"start":2448.2,"text":"you shortly."},{"start":2448.8,"text":"with the nurse."},{"start":2449.4,"text":"Hi, I'll be taking your vitals today."},{"start":2450,"text":"What brings you in today?"},{"start":2450.6,"text":"Have you taken any medication?"},{"start":2451.2,"text":"Okay. Did it help?"},{"start":2451.8,"text":"All right, let's check your temperature"},{"start":2452.4,"text":"and blood pressure with the doctor."},{"start":2453,"text":"Hi, I'm Dr. Miller. What seems to be the"},{"start":2453.6,"text":"problem?"},{"start":2454.2,"text":"Can you describe your symptoms to me?"},{"start":2454.8,"text":"Mhm."},{"start":2455.4,"text":"Are you coughing?"},{"start":2456,"text":"Any shortness of breath?"},{"start":2456.6,"text":"Let me take a look at your throat."},{"start":2457.2,"text":"Open wide and say, \"Ah.\""},{"start":2457.8,"text":"It looks a bit red."},{"start":2458.4,"text":"You might have a mild infection."},{"start":2459,"text":"No, it doesn't look that serious."},{"start":2459.6,"text":"I'll run a quick test to be sure."},{"start":2460.2,"text":"Are you allergic to any medications?"},{"start":2460.8,"text":"Are you currently taking any other"},{"start":2461.4,"text":"medication?"},{"start":2462,"text":"Have you been under a lot of stress"},{"start":2462.6,"text":"lately?"},{"start":2463.2,"text":"Okay. The test came back negative for"},{"start":2463.8,"text":"strep throat."},{"start":2464.4,"text":"That's good news."},{"start":2465,"text":"Get plenty of rest."},{"start":2465.6,"text":"Drink plenty of fluids"},{"start":2466.2,"text":"and take over theounter pain relievers."},{"start":2466.8,"text":"You should feel better in a few days."},{"start":2467.4,"text":"If your symptoms get worse"},{"start":2468,"text":"or last more than a week,"},{"start":2468.6,"text":"then come back."},{"start":2469.2,"text":"I'm going to prescribe you something for"},{"start":2469.8,"text":"your cough."},{"start":2470.4,"text":"I'll send it to your pharmacy."},{"start":2471,"text":"Which pharmacy do you use?"},{"start":2471.6,"text":"Perfect. You can pick it up later today."},{"start":2472.2,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":2472.8,"text":"Please stop by the front desk on your"},{"start":2473.4,"text":"way out."},{"start":2474,"text":"at the front desk."},{"start":2474.6,"text":"Your co-pay today is $30."},{"start":2475.2,"text":"Yes."},{"start":2475.8,"text":"Feel better soon."},{"start":2476.4,"text":"If you enjoyed this speaking practice,"},{"start":2477,"text":"then leave a like and subscribe for more"},{"start":2477.6,"text":"slow English practice. And I'm sure"},{"start":2478.2,"text":"you'll like these two videos if you"},{"start":2478.8,"text":"liked this one. Remember guys, never"},{"start":2479.4,"text":"stop learning."},{"start":2480,"text":"Bye. [music]"},{"start":2480.6,"text":"[music]"}]}